{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"3 d interaction 3 d interaction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md","fileName":"3D Interaction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"3D Interaction","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Spatial Interaction]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Interaction","Human-Computer Interaction","Virtual Environment","3D User Interface","Input Device","Output Device","Interaction Technique","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"3 d interaction 3 d interaction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md","fileName":"3D Interaction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"3D Interaction","heading":"3D Interaction","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"3D interaction is [[Human-Computer Interaction]] in which the user's task is performed directly in a real or [[Virtual Environment|virtual]] three-dimensional spatial context.\n\nDisplaying 3D graphics does not by itself create 3D interaction. Choosing a viewpoint from a conventional menu is still ordinary menu interaction, while selecting a location in a 3D world with a 2D mouse can count as 3D interaction because the input is mapped directly to a spatial target. Spatial input such as hand gestures or physical walking is common but not required.\n\nA [[3D User Interface]] combines 3D interaction with suitable [[Input Device]]s, [[Output Device]]s, and [[Interaction Technique]]s.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Interaction","Human-Computer Interaction","Virtual Environment","3D User Interface","Input Device","Output Device","Interaction Technique","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"3 d interaction 3 d interaction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/3D Interaction.md","fileName":"3D Interaction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"3D Interaction","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Interaction","Human-Computer Interaction","Virtual Environment","3D User Interface","Input Device","Output Device","Interaction Technique","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}